ace. The operating system for professional-services firms.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"PYNGYN\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"PYNGYN: Clientspace, a standalone branded client portal, and Workspace, a standalone back office for professional-services firms\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"PYNGYN: The operating system for professional-services firms\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Run your firm and every client engagement in one place. The operating system for professional-services firms.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-organization\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"legalName\":\"VIMOVI GlobalTech Private Limited\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/logo.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"image\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/icon.png\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN gives every client a branded Client Space (a standalone portal for status, documents, and approvals), with Workspace, the firm's back office for projects, finances, and billable time, available on its own or bundled together.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/Pyngyn_Official\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/pyngyn/\",\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Pyngyn_Official/\",\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61584474731354\",\"https://www.youtube.com/@PyngynOfficial\",\"https://instagram.com/pyngyn_official\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"email\":\"support@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/support\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"email\":\"sales@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/demo\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-website\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"The operating system for professional-services firms. Run your firm and every client engagement in one place.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[200] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-accent focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white\">Skip to content</a><main id=\"main\" class=\"hero-dark relative min-h-screen text-white antialiased\"><style>html,body{background:#0b0d12 !important;}</style><div class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 opacity-30\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"hero-grid h-full w-full\"></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1180px] items-center justify-between px-5 pt-7 sm:px-7\"><img alt=\"PYNGYN\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo-dark.webp\"/><span class=\"hidden items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-white/70 sm:inline-flex\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></span> Built for professional services</span></div><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1180px] grid-cols-1 items-start gap-12 px-5 pb-16 pt-12 sm:px-7 sm:pb-24 sm:pt-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr] lg:gap-10\"><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent\"><span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\"><span class=\"absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-accent opacity-75\"></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span></span>7-day free trial · No credit card required</span><h1 class=\"mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(38px,6.8vw,72px)] font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.035em] text-white\">Your team isn&#x27;t unproductive.<!-- --> <span class=\"text-indigo-300\">Your operations are broken.</span></h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[560px] text-[17.5px] leading-[1.55] text-white/65\">Disconnected updates, slipping deadlines, scattered tasks, and zero live visibility quietly eat your margin every week. PYNGYN is the AI operating system built for services firms, so your team runs on a predictable system instead of heroics.</p><div class=\"mt-9 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white shadow-cta transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-dk \">Book a demo<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.04] px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:border-white/30 hover:bg-white/[0.08] \">Start free trial</a></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-white/65\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg> 7-day free trial</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg> No credit card</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg> SOC 2 aligned</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg> SSO / SAML</span></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -left-3 -top-4 z-10 hidden rotate-[-3deg] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#11141a]/95 px-3.5 py-2.5 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur sm:block\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/65\">Risk caught early</div><div class=\"mt-0.5 font-display text-[18px] font-semibold leading-tight text-emerald-400\">3 days sooner</div></div><div class=\"absolute -right-4 top-16 z-10 hidden rotate-[2deg] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#11141a]/95 px-3.5 py-2.5 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur sm:block\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/65\">Status drafts</div><div class=\"mt-0.5 font-display text-[18px] font-semibold leading-tight text-white\">Auto-written</div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.05] to-white/[0.02] p-4 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur sm:p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span></div><div class=\"rounded-md bg-white/[0.04] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-white/65\">app.pyngyn.ai / ops</div><div class=\"w-8\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/70\">Live operations</div><div class=\"mt-0.5 font-display text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\">This week, your firm</div></div><span class=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-400\">On track</span></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-3\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/70\">Engagements</div><div class=\"mt-1 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-accent\">14</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10.5px] text-white/70\">2 at risk</div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-3\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/70\">Billable hrs</div><div class=\"mt-1 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-white\">372</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10.5px] text-white/70\">this week</div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-3\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/70\">Utilisation</div><div class=\"mt-1 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-emerald-400\">78%</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10.5px] text-white/70\">healthy</div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/70\">Delivery confidence, last 14 days</div><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-400\">+12 pts</span></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 56\" class=\"mt-2 h-12 w-full\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"lp-sg\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#4f46e5\" stop-opacity=\"0.35\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#4f46e5\" stop-opacity=\"0\"></stop></linearGradient></defs><path d=\"M0,42 L20,40 L40,44 L60,36 L80,38 L100,30 L120,32 L140,24 L160,20 L180,22 L200,14 L220,18 L240,10\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M0,42 L20,40 L40,44 L60,36 L80,38 L100,30 L120,32 L140,24 L160,20 L180,22 L200,14 L220,18 L240,10 L240,56 L0,56 Z\" fill=\"url(#lp-sg)\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"mt-3 space-y-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-3 py-2\"><span class=\"flex-none rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400\">Risk</span><p class=\"text-[11.5px] leading-snug text-white/75\">Acme audit may slip by 2 days, partner review pending</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-3 py-2\"><span class=\"flex-none rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide bg-accent/15 text-accent\">AI</span><p class=\"text-[11.5px] leading-snug text-white/75\">Drafted Friday status for 9 engagements - ready to send</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-3 py-2\"><span class=\"flex-none rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400\">Won</span><p class=\"text-[11.5px] leading-snug text-white/75\">Beacon Capital approved phase 2 - 3 weeks of work added</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-white/10 bg-black/20\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-6 sm:px-7\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-7 gap-y-3 text-[12.5px] font-medium text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/60\">Built for</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-white/25\"></span> <!-- -->CA &amp; Tax firms</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-white/25\"></span> <!-- -->Consulting firms</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-white/25\"></span> <!-- -->Marketing &amp; creative agencies</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-white/25\"></span> <!-- -->Law firms</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-white/25\"></span> <!-- -->Architecture firms</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-white/25\"></span> <!-- -->Audit &amp; advisory</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-white/25\"></span> <!-- -->Boutique advisory</span></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-20 sm:px-7 sm:py-28\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px]\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span> <!-- -->The hidden cost of operational chaos</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,46px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\">Most firms don&#x27;t have a productivity problem.<br/>They have an operations problem.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">The team isn&#x27;t lazy. The work isn&#x27;t hard. The system underneath it is leaking time, money, and trust. Here&#x27;s where it goes.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Coordination</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-white/60\">01<!-- --> / <!-- -->06</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[19.5px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Status lives in 30 places.</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Updates are scattered across WhatsApp, email, and spreadsheets. Nobody has the full picture before a client call, and your client has even less.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-4\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-amber-400\"><path d=\"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v5M12 18h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-white/80\">Hours lost weekly per manager.</span></div></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Delivery</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-white/60\">02<!-- --> / <!-- -->06</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[19.5px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Deadlines slip without warning.</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Risk is invisible until it has already cost you the date. The first time you hear about a problem is when the client does.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-4\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-amber-400\"><path d=\"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v5M12 18h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-white/80\">Margin and trust, gone together.</span></div></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Scope</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-white/60\">03<!-- --> / <!-- -->06</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[19.5px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Scope creeps in silence.</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Small asks pile up between formal change orders. The team works extra, the firm absorbs the cost, the client never knew.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-4\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-amber-400\"><path d=\"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v5M12 18h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-white/80\">Quiet revenue leak.</span></div></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Knowledge</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-white/60\">04<!-- --> / <!-- -->06</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[19.5px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Senior people are bottlenecks.</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">SOPs and client context sit in one partner&#x27;s head. When they take leave, work slows. When they leave, knowledge walks out the door.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-4\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-amber-400\"><path d=\"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v5M12 18h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-white/80\">Quality depends on availability.</span></div></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Accountability</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-white/60\">05<!-- --> / <!-- -->06</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[19.5px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Ownership is fuzzy.</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Several people are on a task but nobody really owns it. Things drift. Follow-ups become a job in itself.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-4\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-amber-400\"><path d=\"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v5M12 18h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-white/80\">Endless chasing, no progress.</span></div></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Visibility</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-white/60\">06<!-- --> / <!-- -->06</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[19.5px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">You learn about losses after the invoice.</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Without live engagement health, you only find out a project was unprofitable after billing. By then it&#x27;s already too late to fix.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-4\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-amber-400\"><path d=\"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v5M12 18h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-white/80\">P&amp;L surprises every quarter.</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-white/10 bg-black/20\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1180px] grid-cols-1 divide-y divide-white/10 px-5 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:divide-x sm:divide-y-0 sm:px-7\"><div class=\"px-2 py-8 text-center\"><div class=\"font-display text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-white\">35%</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug text-white/65\">of a billable day, lost to coordination</div></div><div class=\"px-2 py-8 text-center\"><div class=\"font-display text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-accent\">~$1.85M</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug text-white/65\">illustrative annual cost of chaos at a 20-person firm</div></div><div class=\"px-2 py-8 text-center\"><div class=\"font-display text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-emerald-400\">~39 days</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug text-white/65\">billable time back, per person, per year</div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] px-5 pb-5 text-center sm:px-7\"><a href=\"/tools/roi-calculator\" class=\"text-[12.5px] font-medium text-white/65 underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent hover:underline\">Run the numbers for your firm →</a></div></section><section class=\"px-5 py-10 sm:px-7 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-accent/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/15 via-accent/5 to-transparent p-9 sm:p-12\"><div class=\"hero-grid pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-30\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-start gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px]\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-accent\">7-day trial · No credit card</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(24px,3.6vw,34px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-white\">Stop running client work through chaos.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">In 30 minutes we map a real engagement of yours and show exactly where PYNGYN saves time.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white shadow-cta transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-dk \">Book a demo<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.04] px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:border-white/30 hover:bg-white/[0.08] \">Start free trial</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-20 sm:px-7 sm:py-28\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span> <!-- -->The PYNGYN difference</span><h2 class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,46px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\">Not another project tool.<!-- --> <span class=\"text-indigo-300\">An AI Operations Manager.</span></h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-[640px] text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Traditional tools organise tasks. PYNGYN improves operational decisions. Eight capabilities most services firms have never had until now.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-accent/10 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M6 6l2.5 2.5M15.5 15.5L18 18M18 6l-2.5 2.5M8.5 15.5L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative mt-4 font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\">AI plan generation</h3><p class=\"relative mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60\">Type the goal. PYNGYN drafts tasks, owners, dependencies, and a realistic timeline.</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-accent/10 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M7 3h7l4 4v14H7zM14 3v4h4M9 12h6M9 16h4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative mt-4 font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\">Auto-generated status</h3><p class=\"relative mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60\">PYNGYN drafts client-ready status updates from the work itself. The Friday roll-up writes itself.</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-accent/10 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 3l10 18H2zM12 10v5M12 18h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative mt-4 font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\">Risk detection</h3><p class=\"relative mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60\">AI watches workload, dependencies, and deadlines. It flags what threatens dates and margin, days earlier.</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-accent/10 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M5 20V10M10 20V4M15 20v-8M20 20V7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative mt-4 font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\">Workload balancing</h3><p class=\"relative mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60\">See who is over-allocated this week before they tell you. Rebalance before quality drops.</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-accent/10 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></circle><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative mt-4 font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\">AI meeting capture</h3><p class=\"relative mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60\">Decisions and follow-ups from a call become tracked tasks with owners. No more lost commitments.</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-accent/10 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 5a3 3 0 013-3h11v18H7a3 3 0 01-3-3zm3 12h11\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative mt-4 font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\">Living knowledge base</h3><p class=\"relative mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60\">SOPs, frameworks, and client history surface in the workflow when they matter, not when someone remembers them.</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-accent/10 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative mt-4 font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\">Forecast &amp; utilisation</h3><p class=\"relative mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60\">Project capacity weeks ahead. Sell the next engagement with confidence, not hope.</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.05]\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-accent/10 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 11-9-9M21 3l-9 9M16 3h5v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative mt-4 font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\">Operations co-pilot</h3><p class=\"relative mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60\">Ask in plain language. PYNGYN answers across projects, people, and history, with sources.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-20 sm:px-7 sm:py-28\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span> <!-- -->The product</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[clamp(30px,4.5vw,48px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\">Two products. One operating system.</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[580px] text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Client Space gives every client their own branded portal, and works on its own. Workspace runs your firm behind the scenes. Buy either standalone, or bundle both to replace the spreadsheets, WhatsApp threads, and status emails that eat your week.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-[24px] border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"rounded-xl border border-accent/40 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-accent\">Client Space</span><span class=\"text-[13px] text-white/50\">$19 / client / month · standalone</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold text-white\">A branded portal for every client.</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Each client gets their own isolated, white-labeled portal. They see deliverables, status, and approvals, nothing from your other clients, nothing internal.</p><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Branded, white-labeled per client</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>One isolated space per engagement</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Client-visible tasks and status</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Approvals and sign-off in the portal</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>The client role, access-controlled</li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[24px] border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"rounded-xl bg-accent/20 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-accent\">Workspace</span><span class=\"text-[13px] text-white/50\">$9 / seat / month · standalone</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold text-white\">Your firm&#x27;s operating system.</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Everything directors, managers, and ICs need: projects, finances, billable timesheets, Business Brain AI, automations, team skills, and 240+ workflow templates.</p><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Projects, tasks, and calendar</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Finance: revenue, MRR, profit</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Billable vs non-billable timesheets</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Business Brain AI (plans, status, risk)</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-white/80\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Roles for directors, managers, and ICs</li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-20 sm:px-7 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px]\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span> <!-- -->How it works</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[clamp(28px,4vw,42px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\">What happens after you click the button.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[12.5px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-accent\">01</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[19px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">30-minute discovery</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">We learn how your firm delivers today: tools, roles, what hurts.</p></div><div class=\"relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[12.5px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-accent\">02</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[19px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Live walkthrough on your workflow</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">We model a real engagement of yours in PYNGYN. Not a generic demo.</p></div><div class=\"relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[12.5px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-accent\">03</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[19px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Written rollout plan</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">A tailored plan you can share with your team, whether you sign up or not.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-20 sm:px-7 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-16\"><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span> <!-- -->Operational efficiency on the P&amp;L</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[clamp(28px,4vw,42px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\">One missed client deadline costs more than a year of PYNGYN.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Every hour your firm spends chasing status is an hour you can&#x27;t bill. We built a free calculator so you can put a real number on the cost of chaos inside your firm in 30 seconds.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/tools/roi-calculator\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white shadow-cta transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-dk \">Run the calculator<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.04] px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:border-white/30 hover:bg-white/[0.08] \">Or just book a demo</a></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-[12.5px] text-white/65\">Calculator is free, no signup.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/70\">What firms typically get back</div><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-3.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div><div class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-white\">Faster delivery</div><div class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-white/60\">Fewer late dates, fewer apology emails.</div></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div><div class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-white\">Higher utilisation</div><div class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-white/60\">See who is over-allocated before quality drops.</div></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div><div class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-white\">Tighter accountability</div><div class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-white/60\">Owners on every task. No more follow-up follow-ups.</div></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div><div class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-white\">Earlier risk signal</div><div class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-white/60\">Days, not weeks, before the deadline.</div></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div><div class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-white\">Less overhead</div><div class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-white/60\">Status, roll-ups, and handoffs that write themselves.</div></div></li></ul><p class=\"mt-5 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-[11.5px] leading-snug text-white/65\">Outcomes depend on your firm. Run the calculator on your own numbers, or book a demo and we will model it live.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-20 sm:px-7 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px]\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span> <!-- -->Built for your kind of work</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[clamp(28px,4vw,42px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\">One operating system, every services firm.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">PYNGYN is shaped around how services firms actually run, not retrofitted from a generic task tool.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">CA &amp; Tax</span><h3 class=\"mt-3.5 font-display text-[18px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Chartered accounting firms</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white/70\">Pain:</span> <!-- -->Filing seasons turn into fire drills. Partners chase juniors, deadlines hide in trackers.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">Fix:</span> <!-- -->Engagement plans, regulatory calendars, and review queues that run themselves.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Consulting</span><h3 class=\"mt-3.5 font-display text-[18px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Management consulting</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white/70\">Pain:</span> <!-- -->Plans live in slide decks that go stale by Wednesday. Status is a Monday meeting.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">Fix:</span> <!-- -->Live plans, written status, partner reviews that always reflect today&#x27;s reality.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Agencies</span><h3 class=\"mt-3.5 font-display text-[18px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Marketing &amp; creative agencies</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white/70\">Pain:</span> <!-- -->Client work juggled across Slack, Asana, and email. Scope creep funded by your team.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">Fix:</span> <!-- -->Briefs become plans. Approvals and rounds tracked. Profitability visible per client.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Legal</span><h3 class=\"mt-3.5 font-display text-[18px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Law firms &amp; legal teams</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white/70\">Pain:</span> <!-- -->Matters managed across people, calendars, and habits. Risk and conflicts spotted late.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">Fix:</span> <!-- -->Matter workflows, deadline tracking, and risk surfacing built for legal work.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/20\"><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Architecture</span><h3 class=\"mt-3.5 font-display text-[18px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] text-white\">Architecture &amp; design</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white/70\">Pain:</span> <!-- -->Phases stretch quietly. Drawings, revisions, and approvals scattered across drives.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">Fix:</span> <!-- -->Phase-aware project plans, drawing rounds, and stakeholder approvals in one flow.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-20 sm:px-7 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px]\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span> <!-- -->How we compare</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[clamp(28px,4vw,42px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\">A task tool is not an operating system.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Category-level differences. Capabilities marked honestly, full, partial, or none.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-white/[0.04] text-white/65\"><th scope=\"col\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-4 text-[12.5px] font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">Capability</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 bg-accent/10 px-3 py-4 text-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">PYNGYN</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-4 text-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold\">ClickUp</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-4 text-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold\">Trello</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-4 text-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold\">Monday</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-4 text-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold\">Excel</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-4 text-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold\">WhatsApp</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"bg-white/[0.01]\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3.5 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-white\">AI plan from a plain-language goal</th><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center bg-accent/[0.08]\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><span class=\"font-mono text-[16px] font-bold text-amber-400\">~</span></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-white/60\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><span class=\"font-mono text-[16px] font-bold text-amber-400\">~</span></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-white/60\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-white/60\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3.5 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-white\">Status updates that write themselves</th><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center bg-accent/[0.08]\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-white/60\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-