2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><span class=\"font-mono text-[16px] font-bold text-amber-400\">~</span></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-white/60\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-white/60\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3.5 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-white\">Live workload balancing across the team</th><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center bg-accent/[0.08]\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-center \"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto text-white/60\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-3.5 text-cen